    note right of CHECKPOINT_PENDING
        Email finalization locks Source owner before contact.
        Binding, principal promotion and audit intent commit together.
        Signup policies compare expiry against the owning Ticket database clock.
        At the exact deadline, finalization authorization is refused.
        The controller rebuilds context and revalidates policy under the Ticket lock.
        After Source commit and Ticket failure, the same bound email birthdate POST
        reconciles one original Source intent without rewriting binding or birthdate.
        Released binding, duplicate intent, unavailable owner and expired flow refuse.
    end note
